<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15777" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτ-ῡμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>condiment, seasoning,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτύμασι παντοδαποῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Batr.
					41
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aff.</u>
				43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.36
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βορᾶς ἀρτύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					675
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				709
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ παλαιὰ καὶ θρυλούμενα ἀρτύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxipp.
					1.5
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀνάπαυσις τῶν πόνων ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.9c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαθήκη, δίκη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτημα</span>).</div>
